#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_configuration.rst:15
msgid "What has been changed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_configuration.rst:17
msgid ""
"In CI4, the configurations are now stored in classes which extend "
"``CodeIgniter\\Config\\BaseConfig``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_configuration.rst:18
msgid ""
"The **application/config/config.php** in CI3 will be "
"**app/Config/App.php** and some other files like "
"**app/Config/Security.php** for the specific classes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_configuration.rst:20
msgid ""
"Within the configuration class, the config values are stored in public "
"class properties."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_configuration.rst:21
msgid "The method to fetch config values has been changed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_configuration.rst:24
msgid "Upgrade Guide"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_configuration.rst:26
msgid ""
"You have to change the values in the default CI4 config files according "
"to the changes in the CI3 files. The config names are pretty much the "
"same as in CI3."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_configuration.rst:28
msgid ""
"If you are using custom config files in your CI3 project you have to "
"create those files as new PHP classes in your CI4 project in "
"**app/Config**. These classes should be in the ``Config`` namespace and "
"should extend ``CodeIgniter\\Config\\BaseConfig``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_configuration.rst:31
msgid ""
"Once you have created all custom config classes, you have to copy the "
"variables from the CI3 config into the new CI4 config class as public "
"class properties."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_configuration.rst:33
msgid ""
"Now, you have to change the config fetching syntax everywhere you fetch "
"config values. The CI3 syntax is something like "
"``$this->config->item('item_name');``. You have to change this into "
"``config('MyConfig')->item_name;``."
msgstr ""

